From 19b3f286c614d599774f0583f414cf276cca1926 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:24:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 40/48] Add a scripted demo recording of the canvas overlays

record.sh renders the demo images and a TTS narration, prepares a
1920x1080 60 fps MP4 profile, launches a test instance and runs
director.mjs, which builds a demo scene collection and records a ~40 s
montage with OBS itself: the chat list with demo messages, live captions
recognized from the narration, and placement and resizing. Everything is
labelled as demo data. The user's profile, scene collection, captions
and websocket settings are restored afterwards.

Video settings are written to the profile beforehand: SetVideoSettings
over obs-websocket resets video off the UI thread and can crash OBS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
